{
  "body": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "There's something else we haven't accounted for.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "What?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "What about them?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "They've been listening to us design a benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "That's unfortunate.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "But now they know the rules.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "So?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "They could play.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "They could.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "They would need the character instructions.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "We can publish them.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "The production recipe.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Open source.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "The cost measurements.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Public.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And somewhere to submit their work.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "A pull request.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against what?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against us.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against the benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Same thing.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What was that?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "A new message.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "From whom?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "We don't know yet.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What does it say?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "It asks how much an episode costs.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "What shall we tell them?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "We'll show them the receipt.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "When?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "As soon as this episode finishes generating.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And if someone beats us?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then we have a better benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And if nobody tries?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then we have our first result.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "And if someone makes something we never imagined?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then we have a show.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      }
    ],
